  "prefLabel": "Ins 1300 PRODUCERS AND ADJUSTERS",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Ins 1300 PRODUCERS AND ADJUSTERS\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 400-A:11, I.; 400-A:15, I.; RSA 402-B:6; RSA 402-D:20; RSA 402- J:18\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #8934, effective 8-1-07, made extensive changes to the wording, format, structure, and numbering of rules in Chapter Ins 1300. Document #8934 deleted the former Part Ins 1303 entitled “Fiduciary Obligation of Agents and Brokers”, but Document #8935, also effective 8-1-07, adopted Chapter Ins 4300 entitled “Fiduciary Obligation of Producers” containing rules from the former Part Ins 1303. See Chapter Ins 4300 for all subsequent filings in that area.\n\nDocuments #8934 and #8935 supersede all prior filings for the former Chapter Ins 1300. The filings affecting the former Chapter Ins 1300 include the following documents:\n\n#1900, eff 1-1-82\n\n#4176, eff 12-2-86\n\n#4287, eff 7-1-87\n\n#4492, eff 9-23-98\n\n#5227, eff 9-23-91\n\n#5650, eff 7-1-93\n\n#7029, eff 7-1-99, INTERIM\n\n#7124, eff 10-29-99",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins1300.html"
